# SLIDE 11: ADVANTAGES, LIMITATIONS, AND FUTURE SCOPE

## Advantages

* Simple and organized interface.
* Easy-to-understand dashboard.
* Separate sections for asset information.
* Improved visibility of inventory records.
* Beginner-friendly web development project.
* Easy customization using HTML and CSS.

## Limitations

* Asset records are predefined.
* No database integration.
* No dynamic add, edit, or delete operations.
* Search and filtering are not functional.
* No user authentication.
* Reports are not generated automatically.

## Future Enhancements

* Add JavaScript for interactive features.
* Integrate a database to store records.
* Develop a backend using Node.js and Express.js.
* Add secure login and role-based access.
* Implement asset search and filtering.
* Add QR codes for asset identification.
* Provide maintenance reminders.
* Enable report downloads.

These improvements could transform the prototype into a complete asset management application.

